-- Window "Zahlungsplan" (AD_Window_ID=275), header tab "Rechnung" (AD_Tab_ID=501): give it a persisted WebUI layout.
-- Until now the tab had no AD_UI_Section, so its layout was generated in memory from AD_Field and no field had a widget size.
-- Because an inline filter takes the widget size of its field's layout element, the inline partner filter rendered at the
-- default width. This layout sets the partner (with location and contact) to widget size L, like the sales invoice window.
--
-- Part 1: layout generated by the process AD_Window_CreateUIElements (recorded; only the header tab is kept,
--         the detail tab 502 keeps its in-memory layout).
-- Part 2: groups, order and widget sizes following the sales invoice window (167); in the grid the document type,
--         number and date come first, status and organisation last; the client is not shown in the grid.

